        "relative_start_ms": 21800,
        "relative_end_ms": 24000,
        "type": "camera",
        "speaker": null,
        "text": "Medium shot on Catherine in her bridal gown and Lord Henry Sterling seated in the front pew, both frozen in stunned shock."
